      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T16:54:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If this is something we always want at the top of our shaders, we should just add it to WGSLCodeGenerator, rather than making a copy of the entire program string just to tack it on.\n\nOn the other hand--maybe it should be a program setting? This would not be viable if we wanted to make CanvasKit for WebGPU. (Counter-counterpoint: this is graphite/**dawn**, not graphite/webgpu, and I expect we\u0027d need bigger changes as well.)",
